State_Space:
AB-EA base: SoC; wholesale electricity price; 

AB-EA extended: SoC; wholesale electricity price; sin/cos-encoded hour; sin/cos-encoded week; sin/cos-encoded month; stacked observations from 2–24 previous timesteps (concatenated into current state);

DE-LF/REU base: SoC; wholesale electricity price; available RE generation; power demand; 

DE-LF/REU extended: SoC; wholesale electricity price; available RE generation; power demand; sin/cos-encoded hour; sin/cos-encoded week; sin/cos-encoded month; stacked observations from 2–24 previous timesteps (concatenated into current state);

Action_Type:
DQN: Discrete 3-action (full charge; idle; full discharge) or 17 evenly-spaced levels'
PPO: Continuous; or discrete 3-action; or discrete 17-action;
SAC / DDPG: Continuous charge/discharge power;
